(7295417, 1137446, 30490, '<td valign="top">My favorite in this challenge.  I love the realistic image, good use of color and control of the glare.  Jar is interesting with the cool distortion w/in the glass.  Nice job!</td>', 'My favorite in this challenge.  I love the realistic image, good use of color and control of the glare.  Jar is interesting with the cool distortion w/in the glass.  Nice job!', '2014-12-24 13:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
