(7296985, 1137645, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. From the small size I''m guessing it was a frame grab from a high speed sequence?</td>', 'Nice capture. From the small size I''m guessing it was a frame grab from a high speed sequence?', '2014-12-30 20:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
