(7296990, 1137708, 13077, '<td valign="top">A pretty nice set up, but not crazy about the color of the background and also there are some artifacts around the edge of the little umbrella, not sure what from - maybe motion blur, or selection artifacts?</td>', 'A pretty nice set up, but not crazy about the color of the background and also there are some artifacts around the edge of the little umbrella, not sure what from - maybe motion blur, or selection artifacts?', '2014-12-30 20:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
