(7297085, 1137645, 113016, '<td valign="top">Thanks for looking everyone.<br/>Jon, it was all faux.  It''s a product called Plasti-dip. Used to put a plastic coating on tools, etc.<br/>I sprayed it on plastic wrap and when it dried, it peeled off as a thin layer of plastic which I wrapped around my face in an effort to portray exactly what you thought you saw...that split second in time...before it stuck to my face.<br/>The aspect is just my overall preference to 16:9.  Thanks for the comment!</td>', 'Thanks for looking everyone.Jon, it was all faux.  It''s a product called Plasti-dip. Used to put a plastic coating on tools, etc.I sprayed it on plastic wrap and when it dried, it peeled off as a thin layer of plastic which I wrapped around my face in an effort to portray exactly what you thought you saw...that split second in time...before it stuck to my face.The aspect is just my overall preference to 16:9.  Thanks for the comment!', '2014-12-31 02:24:53.000000', NULL, 0),
